# Keep secrets, local state and tests out of the image (and out of the build context).
.git
.gitignore
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.db
**/*.db.bak
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.hypothesis
**/.import_linter_cache
**/*.egg-info
**/node_modules
frontend/dist
backend/tests
backend/eval-report.md
CLAUDE.md
README.md
